{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-vod-cdn.tvb.com/d268c7bc948b46a6995295c68e6d1181/snapshots/96ae97ee8cbe437a91561346b6918157-00007.jpg\"/><p>一股寒流在中國山西省永濟市的鸛雀樓產生罕見的平流霧，令這座逾千年歷史的地標看似漂浮於雲海之中。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"8507527_寒潮現平流霧 鸛雀樓浮雲海 俯瞰神州 - 截图5\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-vod-cdn.tvb.com/d268c7bc948b46a6995295c68e6d1181/snapshots/96ae97ee8cbe437a91561346b6918157-00005.jpg\"/></p></p><p></p><p>黎明時分，薄霧沿黃河緩緩飄移，縈繞塔樓。晨光穿透霧氣，隱約顯現樓閣的多層飛簷在流雲中起伏，宛如一幅中國傳統山水畫。</p><p></p><p>平流霧通常於深秋至初春的夜間及清晨形成，當溫暖潮濕的空氣在微風伴隨下，掠過較涼的水面時便會出現。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"8507527_寒潮現平流霧 鸛雀樓浮雲海 俯瞰神州 - 截图1\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-vod-cdn.tvb.com/d268c7bc948b46a6995295c68e6d1181/snapshots/96ae97ee8cbe437a91561346b6918157-00001.jpg\"/></p></p><p></p><p>這種現象可突然出現又突然消散，令景觀難得一見。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T00:43:25.564585+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":178,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T00:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T03:02:08.269574+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T00:37:14.621178+00:00","content_hash":"c901668edaa6b6f3dc9517bb6c604c83742759a97449e970f388d5a79ae2813e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-23T00:43:25.564585+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}